      "title": "Bhavya Shiv Shobha Yatra",
      "description": "Our grandest celebration of the year. In the holy month of Sawan the samiti carried Mahadev through the streets of East Azad Nagar and Krishna Nagar — with jhankis of Shiv, Mahakali and Mata Rani, an aghori fire dance, dhol, DJ and hundreds of devotees dancing in bhakti.\n\nThe day began at 1:00 PM with abhishek, divya shringar, prasad, mangal aarti and bhajan-kirtan at the mandir. The procession set off at 3:00 PM and returned for vishram at 6:00 PM, followed by a vishal bhandara of aloo sabzi, puri and kheer, served by Shri Balaji Mitra Mandal.",
